{"title":"Gem Diamond","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Gaunt Ogre, Sellsword, Bandit, Virikh, Ogre Butcher +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 1 of 10 looted corpses (1/10)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sellsword\" title=\"Sellsword - dropped it in 1 of 38 looted corpses (1/38)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/afa1d7f81a70bebcbcb2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sellsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/38<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - dropped it in 1 of 131 looted corpses (1/131)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/131<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 1 of 166 looted corpses (1/166)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/166<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 170 looted corpses (1/170)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/170<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 1 of 850 looted corpses (1/850)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/850<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gem-diamond\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>52</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=1\">1c <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=2\">2c <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=3\">3c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=3.5\">3.5c</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=4\">4c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 4c. Up to 2c counts as common. The witch can build up to 3c (one 3c takes 243 small gems); 3.5c and 4c only come from finds, and a 4c gem is very rare.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Diamond found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Duelist)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>52 <span class=\"muted\">(72%)</span></td><td>62%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>Duelist: +≈0.38% crit chance</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>9 <span class=\"muted\">(13%)</span></td><td>16%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+ or the witch (3 × 0.5c, 2,500 gold)</td><td>Duelist: +0.75% crit chance</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>4 <span class=\"muted\">(5.6%)</span></td><td>9.5%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+ or the witch (3 × 1c, 2,500 gold)</td><td>Duelist: +≈1.13% crit chance</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>4 <span class=\"muted\">(5.6%)</span></td><td>6.1%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+ or the witch (3 × 1.5c, 2,500 gold)</td><td>Duelist: +1.5% crit chance</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(2.8%)</span></td><td>2.7%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or the witch (3 × 2c, 5,000 gold, after her quest Swallowed Stones)</td><td>Duelist: +≈1.88% crit chance</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=3\" title=\"Show the 3c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.90)\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">3c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-semi-rare\">semi-rare</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(1.4%)</span></td><td>1.1%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or the witch (3 × 2.5c, 10,000 gold, after her quest Dragon’s Hoard)</td><td>Duelist: +2.25% crit chance</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=3.5\" title=\"Show the 3.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.95)\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">3.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-rare\">rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>1.3%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Duelist: +≈2.63% crit chance</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-diamond?q=4\" title=\"Show the 4c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.00)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>0.4%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Duelist: +3% crit chance</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">72 Diamond recorded: 71 while gathering, 1 from monsters. “Of all gems found” is out of 702 gems of every kind. <a href=\"#/gemcombine\">Gem combiner</a></p>\n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/2ac00ba9cb25d4b0d423.svg\" alt=\"Gem Diamond\"></div><h3>Gem Diamond <span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">(1.5c)</span></h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/22/2026, 10:03:31 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}